          "author": "c2bo",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "state": "COMMENTED",
          "body": "I believe there is some confusion with `kid` vs `keyid`, although i am not sure i got everything right with the proposed changes.",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-25T20:02:56Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-07-25T20:23:50Z",
          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 123,
              "body": "This should be `keyid` i assume?\n```suggestion\n* Include the `keyid` signature parameter uniquely identifying the key.\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-07-25T20:02:56Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-07-25T20:23:50Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 313,
              "body": "```suggestion\nThe RS determines the key bound to the token (in this example, assume the RS introspects the token to get the key material) and validates the `kid` value against that the `keyid` in the signature input. The RS determines the algorithm from the key material.\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-07-25T20:09:20Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-07-25T20:23:50Z"
            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 180,
              "body": "```suggestion\n- `keyid` the identifier for the key to be used for binding the token (matching `kid` in the token); if client uses pre-registered keys as in {{preregister}}, the value MUST match the `httpsig_bound_access_token_kid` value\n```",
              "createdAt": "2026-07-25T20:10:05Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-07-25T20:23:50Z"
            }
          ]
        },
